# Cursor Coding Agent Rules

CRITICAL INSTRUCTION:
Before editing any files, writing code, or performing reviews, you MUST read all files in the `.agents/` directory:
- .agents/context.md
- .agents/implementation_plan.md
- .agents/rules/*.md
- .agents/security.md
- .agents/workflow.md
- .agents/review.md

Follow the 3-round workflow in .agents/workflow.md.
